<title>SINGAPORE: Straits Steamship names new chairman.</title>
<headline>Straits Steamship names new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Straits Steamship Land Ltd (SSL) said on Monday it had appointed Lim Chee Onn as its new chairman with effect from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Lim takes over from Sim Kee Boon, a statement from SSL said. SSL is part of conglomerate Keppel Corp.</p>
<p>Sim will remain executive chairman of Keppel Corp and chairman of Keppel Bank of Singapore Ltd.</p>
<p>Lim was appointed deputy chairman of SSL in January 1994 and was its managing director since 1986. He is also senior executive director of Keppel Corp and director of Far East Levingston Shipbuilding Ltd, Keppel Integrated Engineering Ltd and Keppel Bank, all companies within the Keppel group.</p>
<p>Lim also sits on the boards of Singapore Airlines Ltd, Natsteel Ltd and General Securities Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
